# Layered scene assets

When the pack has **individual** cutouts (e.g. `forjd-milk-scene-elements`):

## Assemble

1. Read pack `README.md` / `manifest.json` first
2. Map every path into `@/config/brand` (group under `milkScene` / `scene`)
3. Prefer **webp**; `object-contain` on isolated objects
4. Do **not** stack alternate composites (e.g. `03` together with `04`+`05`)
5. Layer order: bg → rock/platform → center → orbit ring → satellites → glow

## Motion (CSS first)

- Slow 360°: `transform` + `linear` infinite (~18–28s); stagger via CSS vars
- Orbit travel: parent rotates; child **counter-rotates** same duration so art stays upright
- `will-change: transform` only on large spinning layers
- Always disable under `prefers-reduced-motion`
- No new animation libraries (`packages.mdc`)

## Shells

Rounded circles: `rounded-full` + soft border/glow; keep sizes responsive (`%` + `max-w`); `pointer-events-none` on decorative orbs

## Mobile

Cap orb size on 320/390; stage `overflow-hidden` / `overflow-x-clip`; no page scroll from satellites
